{"input": "直接教我一个小知识点：向量检索中，相似度高为什么不保证答案正确？只讲这个知识点，简短解释后出一道让我用自己的话复述的检查题。讲稳定原理，不需要网页搜索。", "seconds": 12.46, "status": "completed", "error": null, "intent": {"conversation_kind": "ordinary", "clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "reply_feedback": "none", "reply_purpose": "none", "knowledge_card_status": false, "status_context": null, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "resource_boundary": "none", "resource_learning_request": "", "learning_reply_sentence_limit": null, "intents": ["goal"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "向量检索中相似度高为什么不保证答案正确", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": "source_learning", "scope": "learning", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户明确要求直接教一个具体知识点并出复述检查题，属于直接教学请求，主题与用途已足够明确，无需澄清或搜索。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": true, "direct_teaching": true, "answer_only": false, "is_jd": false, "material_focus": "none", "jd_request": "none", "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": ["向量检索", "相似度与正确性"], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "run_state": {"run_id": "20ce8f66-18ff-4171-bc2a-78a91091f109", "revision": 1, "task_id": "1a33fda6-51e7-4cf3-94f8-aaee37a067e3", "lifecycle_revision": 0, "dialogue_only": null, "knowledge_status_reply": null, "execution_complete": true, "capture_scope_update": null, "evaluated_binding": null, "verified_concepts": null, "capture_quotes": null, "capture_feedback_quotes": null}, "session_state": {"active_task_id": "1a33fda6-51e7-4cf3-94f8-aaee37a067e3", "lifecycle_revision": 0, "draft_id": null, "draft_version": null}, "task_states": [{"task_id": "1a33fda6-51e7-4cf3-94f8-aaee37a067e3", "mode": "source_learning", "stage": "teaching", "status": "awaiting_user", "understanding": "unknown", "requires_mastery": false, "memory_invalidated": false, "learning_plan": {"id": "1a33fda6-51e7-4cf3-94f8-aaee37a067e3", "version": 1, "goal": "向量检索中相似度高为什么不保证答案正确", "steps": [{"id": "74de985c-ff6a-4f0c-b71e-24bd6e8d54a2", "state": "explained", "understanding": "unknown", "message_ids": ["bdd79604-292d-4c22-89dd-aac6478174b0"], "completion_condition": "能说明相似度是对查询与文本向量接近程度的度量", "title": "理解向量相似度衡量的是什么"}, {"id": "ab3149b6-a36c-4098-a356-2b755747d488", "state": "pending", "understanding": "unknown", "message_ids": [], "completion_condition": "能指出至少两类高相似却不正确或不充分的情形（如目标错位、信息压缩丢失细节）", "title": "识别高相似度不保证正确的几类原因"}, {"id": "4e7f794c-f916-4059-bf38-de921da2d765", "state": "pending", "understanding": "unknown", "message_ids": [], "completion_condition": "能完整复述相似度衡量‘像不像’而非‘对不对、够不够’", "title": "能用自己的话完整复述相似度与正确性的区别"}], "current_step_id": "74de985c-ff6a-4f0c-b71e-24bd6e8d54a2", "success_check": "能独立用自己的话说明：相似度衡量的是语义/向量空间中的接近程度，而不保证内容正确、完整或能回答问题"}}], "coach_calls": [{"node": "lesson", "schema": "TeachingConversationOutput", "task_id": "1a33fda6-51e7-4cf3-94f8-aaee37a067e3", "task_status": "accepted", "task_stage": "accepted", "capture_candidates": [], "update_instruction_present": false, "returned_capture_update": null, "returned_learning_concepts": ["向量检索", "相似度度量", "语义相似与答案正确性的区别"]}], "replies": ["**向量检索**先做一件事：把查询和每段文本各自变成一个向量（一串数字），再用余弦相似度或点积等度量算它们“方向有多接近”。相似度高只说明**两段文字在向量空间里的位置接近**，不等于它包含问题所需的答案。\n\n原因主要有几层：\n\n- **目标错位**：检索的分数衡量的是“语义接近查询”，而你要的是“能回答问题”。问题像问句，答案常是陈述句；问“为什么相似度高不代表正确”和文档写“检索的召回率与正确率不同”，语义接近，但文档可能根本没讲原因。\n- **向量有压缩损失**：把长文本压成一个向量会丢掉细节、否定、数字、条件。像“可以退票”和“不可以退票”，整体主题很接近，向量距离可能很小，但结论相反。\n- **语义接近不等于事实正确**：高相似只代表表达相近，不代表内容真实、时效对、适用于你的场景。相似度没有“真假”这个概念。\n- **分数是相对的**：多数情况下你取的是排名靠前的若干条，高分可能只是“在所有候选里相对最像”，未必真的足够回答。\n\n用一句话概括：**相似度衡量“像不像”，不衡量“对不对、够不够”**。所以高相似结果只能当作候选，还需要后续判断或核对。\n\n现在请用你自己的话复述一遍：**为什么两个向量相似度高，仍然可能给不出正确答案？** 说清楚分数量的是什么、以及它没保证什么即可。\n\n---\n\n### 想一想\n\n请用自己的话复述：为什么两个向量相似度高，仍然可能给不出正确答案？说清楚分数量的是什么、以及它没保证什么。"], "offers": [], "model_calls": 4, "model_usage": [{"id": "8c8f5145-3434-4658-8a91-dff79b2f6ae4", "budget_id": "16ce9540-960c-4a8a-86d1-4791dcbc36d6", "revision": 1, "background": false, "node": "intent", "model": "deepseek-flash", "estimated_input_tokens": 27962, "transport_requests": 1, "usage_state": "reported", "usage": [{"response_id": "9dc5f62f-ccbf-400c-8dfb-f5e181653456", "input_tokens": 12701, "output_tokens": 313, "total_tokens": 13014, "cached_input_tokens": 12544, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash"}], "status": "returned"}, {"id": "d80f7bd6-578a-46c6-a964-c65e4ef9e511", "budget_id": "16ce9540-960c-4a8a-86d1-4791dcbc36d6", "revision": 1, "background": false, "node": "teaching_preparation", "model": "deepseek-flash", "estimated_input_tokens": 1789, "transport_requests": 1, "usage_state": "reported", "usage": [{"response_id": "6ebecc0b-7b66-409a-b44b-6453f4292dab", "input_tokens": 914, "output_tokens": 96, "total_tokens": 1010, "cached_input_tokens": 768, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash"}], "status": "returned"}, {"id": "6bf3f0f2-5555-4a4b-a3b5-bd30c6adfa1b", "budget_id": "16ce9540-960c-4a8a-86d1-4791dcbc36d6", "revision": 1, "background": false, "node": "lesson", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "estimated_input_tokens": 11199, "transport_requests": 1, "usage_state": "reported", "usage": [{"response_id": "9fd204a1-2022-49cd-9ec4-4fcadbc9ee69", "input_tokens": 5329, "output_tokens": 468, "total_tokens": 5797, "cached_input_tokens": 4608, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash"}], "status": "returned"}, {"id": "33298c83-0020-4c75-898f-ab3a7ba032bc", "budget_id": "16ce9540-960c-4a8a-86d1-4791dcbc36d6", "revision": 1, "background": false, "node": "lesson", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "estimated_input_tokens": 11659, "transport_requests": 1, "usage_state": "reported", "usage": [{"response_id": "fe2d754b-559d-463a-b970-8473e3ea23f9", "input_tokens": 5534, "output_tokens": 734, "total_tokens": 6268, "cached_input_tokens": 3072, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash"}], "status": "returned"}], "evaluation_and_memory_outputs": {}, "errors": []}
